# 5. Quality Gates

- **Gate B — Ready for Implementation:** do not start implementation until Claude's Architecture Package is approved and Codex has reviewed it.
- **Gate C — Ready for QE:** you declare the implementation ready when working local setup, required features, tests, and no hard-coded secrets are in place, README updated, known deviations documented.
- **Gate D — Ready for Release:** you sign off as one of four parties. See `<factory-path>/docs/adr/0006-three-agent-signoff.md`.

